      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce No. 1 Virginia Hall to the market—a turn key two-bedroom apartment ideally positioned within the popular and well-maintained residential development of Virginia Hall in Tallaght, Dublin 24.\n\nThis bright and spacious apartment boasts well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers. Internal living space of c.74 sqm comprises an inviting entrance hallway with ample storage, a generous open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, two well-sized bedrooms, and a main family bathroom.\n\nNo. 1 is further enhanced by a generous balcony spanning the full length of the apartment, accessible from the lounge and both bedrooms, offering an excellent outdoor space.\n\nThe development is professionally managed and benefits from secure, well-maintained communal areas.\n\nIdeally located within close proximity to a host of local amenities including schools, shops, parks, and leisure facilities, with Tallaght Village, The Square Shopping Centre, excellent public transport links, and major road networks all easily accessible.\n\nEarly interest is expected—contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange a viewing.\n\nDetails\n2 bed, 2 bath apartment\nc.74 sqm\nWell-proportioned living accommodation\nTurn key condition\nManagement fee's c. 2200 p/a\nClose to local shops, schools and amenities\nThe Square Shopping Centre on your doorstep\nBuilt c.2006\nExcellent public transport links nearby\nLuas Red line within walking distance\nIdeal for first-time buyers and investors\nEarly viewing is highly advised\n\nBER\nBER: C\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 F2D0"
